/* err.yon — the package file of `err`, under prelude/.
 *
 * The site C(Err): the category of failure. Its objects are Error and the
 * concrete errors that declare themselves into it from below.
 *
 * No generators: failure has no operation of its own. The arrows that
 * matter are the monos (`this < Error`), and those live in the places
 * that declare them — the house is given by the target. */
topos where {
}
